-program-native-consumer-template.lino%22%2C%0A%20%20%22parity%2Fself-translation%2Fnative-number-publication.lino%22%0A%5D%3B%0Aconst%20pin%3Dsource%3D%3E%28%7Bbytes%3ABuffer.byteLength%28source%29%2Csha256%3AcreateHash%28%27sha256%27%29.update%28source%29.digest%28%27hex%27%29%7D%29%3B%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Capture%20exact%20old%20modules%20and%20current%20digests%3B%20this%20proves%20preservation%20only.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20generateNativeCompatibilitySourceHistory%28%7Bcheck%3Dfalse%7D%3D%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20packets%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20%5Bkind%2Cpaths%5Dof%20%5B%5B%27sources%27%2Csources%5D%2C%5B%27fixtures%27%2Cfixtures%5D%5D%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20rows%3Dpaths.map%28file%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20original%3DcaptureGitArtifactCertificate%28revision%2Cfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20verifyGitArtifactCertificate%28original.certificate%2Coriginal.blob%2C%7Brevision%2Cpath%3Afile%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20sourceText%3Doriginal.blob.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%3Bassert.deepEqual%28Buffer.from%28sourceText%29%2Coriginal.blob%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20current%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%29%3Bassert.deepEqual%28Buffer.from%28current.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%29%2Ccurrent%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20return%7Bfile%2Ccommit%3Arevision%2C...pin%28original.blob%29%2CsourceText%2Ccertificate%3Aoriginal.certificate%2Ccurrent%3Apin%28current%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20packet%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2Crevision%2Csources%3Arows%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27Complete%20authenticated%20original%20modules%20and%20fixtures%20remain%20available%20after%20CI%20repairs.%20Different%20current%20operations%20have%20separate%20identities.%20Source%20conservation%20establishes%20neither%20native%20execution%20nor%20general%20semantic%20equivalence%3B%20unchanged%20fixture%20inputs%20and%20independent%20controls%20remain%20mandatory.%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20output%3Dnew%20URL%28%2